{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大字号、高亮度的白色正文，第一眼落在开头“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"明知回去未必能找回曾经的亲近，却仍忍不住想回去试试。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、期待、抱有侥幸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他并不打算因为这点期待就回头忍让，而是想先把眼下日子过好；虽然仍然害怕、没有底气，却决定继续向前走。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块正文较长，包含回头的念想、现实选择、内心恐惧和继续前进等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在开头和后半段，想明白他最终选择了什么，需要把前后内容拼起来。\",\n    \"真正概括处境与感受关系的“害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了”位于正文末尾，第一眼不容易直接拿到。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "50037a9e-94c7-4de8-ab05-e92f0e86de19", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T015712019609Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.032, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:57:53.044827+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "58ea714fea16901398b4b1ffb16ef4050e4c836882f6adef9ac23ad4f8b207e6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools